# Test tooling for the CI test jobs and the Publish test gate, pinned with
# hashes so a run installs exactly what was reviewed, with the runtime
# dependencies at the versions the suite is run against. pywin32 is Windows
# only, as in pyproject.toml. The package itself installs afterwards with
# --no-deps --no-build-isolation, so setuptools, its build backend, comes from
# this lock too. Compiled for the oldest Python the test matrix runs, so one
# lock serves 3.10 to 3.14 on both runners:
#   uv pip compile test.in --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.10 -o test.txt
# Dependabot proposes each new release.
